      "subject": "salat",
      "rationale": "אשמה — rong bilong brukim lo, olsem wokman i bagarapim wok; 'salat' i holim wanpela hap tasol."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "king David",
      "rationale": "Joab i tok dairet long masta bilong en, king."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "ahndred taim",
      "rationale": "Joab i tokim namba — Yahwe i ken givim moa ahndred taim — long pasin bilong agensitim kaunim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "Yahwe i givim moa",
      "rationale": "יוסף יהוה — pasin bilong blesim: 'Yahwe i givim moa' — tok bilong wantok, no toktok stret bilong nomba."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na Joab i tok: Yahwe i givim moa long ol manmeri bilong en, olsem ol i stap, ahndred taim. A, masta bilong mi, king, olgeta ol i bilong masta bilong mi, ol wokman. Bilong wanem masta bilong mi i stap painim dispela samting? Bilong wanem bai i kamap salat long Yisrael?",
